@GatewayAddr = http://localhost:5272

### Buffer depth. Run this while ingestion is stopped and watch it climb.
GET {{GatewayAddr}}/buffer

### Inject a transaction as if it came from the feed generator.
### MessageId is minted by the CALLER on purpose -- that is the whole point.
### AmountMinor is integer minor units; currency is CAD in v1.
POST {{GatewayAddr}}/api/local/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "accountId": "ACCT-0099",
  "sequenceNumber": 1,
  "occurredAt": "2026-08-21T12:00:00Z",
  "amountMinor": 8000,
  "currency": "CAD"
}

### Send the request above twice. Both return 202, one row is buffered.
### The MessageId identity plus content fingerprint collapses the retry;
### same ID with different content returns 409 and preserves the original.

### Bounded forensic view of permanent ingestion rejections (capped at 200 rows).
GET {{GatewayAddr}}/buffer/quarantine?limit=10
